window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>First I made her mine. Then I made her my wife.</b><br> <br> Even standing before me naked with her ass welted, Genevieve Morales looks every bit the ruthless mafia queen she is. But defiant or not, she'll still scream my name as I sink inside her tonight.<br> <br> She'll scream it much louder on our wedding night.<br> <br> A fool would rush to tame a bride like her, but I'm going to savor every moment as she surrenders, bucking and writhing and moaning as she finally gives in and comes <i>hard</i> for me.<br> <br> She already knows she's mine. I'm just going to make her admit it.</p> <p><b>Publisher's Note:</b> <i>Devil's Bride</i> is the first book in the <i>Devil's Syndicate</i> series but can be listened to as a standalone. It includes spankings and rough, intense sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book.</p>"; 
